  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication plan for bicycle use along the BRT in Dakar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Senegalese Urban Transport Authority (CETUD) requested advice to develop a communication plan to raise the awareness about the new bicycle path, the advantages of bicycle use and the mobility plan for (shared) bicycle use along the Bus Rapid Transit (BRT) corridor in Dakar.This project helps CETUD to promote the use of (shared) bicycles as an alternative mode of transportation to the automobile in safe and pleasant conditions and contributes to the improvement of inter-modality along the Bus Rapid Transit (BRT) corridor in Dakar, Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
